      "sentence_id": 8,
      "text": "ORAL ORDER 2 14-03-2024 Heard learned counsel for the parties.\n2. The petitioner apprehends his arrest in a case registered for the offence under Section 376, 506 of the Indian Penal Code and Section 4 / 6 of the POCSO Act.",
      "rhetorical_role": "PREAMBLE",
      "start": 787,
      "end": 1011,
