          "label": "STATUTE",
          "start": 1001,
          "end": 1010
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 9,
      "text": "3. As per the prosecution case, on the false promise of marriage, the petitioner established physical relation with the victim, resulting in her pregnancy, and thereafter, he refused to marry her.",
      "rhetorical_role": "PREAMBLE",
      "start": 1012,
      "end": 1209,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 10,
      "text": "4. It is submitted on behalf of petitioner that from bare perusal of the F.I.R., it is apparent that both parties were in relationship for quiet some time.",
      "rhetorical_role": "PREAMBLE",
      "start": 1210,
      "end": 1366,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 11,
      "text": "They enjoyed each others company for one year together and indulged in sexual act, same cannot be said to be induced or involuntarily.",
      "rhetorical_role": "PREAMBLE",
      "start": 1367,
      "end": 1501,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 12,
      "text": "The relationship was consensual.",
      "rhetorical_role": "PREAMBLE",
      "start": 1502,
      "end": 1534,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 13,
      "text": "The informant was very much capable of understanding the consequences of her action.",
      "rhetorical_role": "PREAMBLE",
      "start": 1535,
      "end": 1619,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 14,
      "text": "Petitioner has got clean antecedent.",
      "rhetorical_role": "PREAMBLE",
      "start": 1620,
      "end": 1656,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
